    "detailed_description": "<h1>The ClusterCluck Discord Server is Live!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/8e2caf8a1b929b07d9ebe2fb934a5dc4.avif?t=1752853368\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong>\ud83c\udf89 The ClusterCluck Discord Server is Live! \ud83d\udc14</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re excited to announce that the official <strong>ClusterCluck Discord server</strong> is now open!<br>Join our growing community to stay up to date with development news, share feedback, connect with other players, and be a part of the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>What\u2019s Inside?</strong><br>\u2022 Dev updates and patch notes<br>\u2022 Tips, tricks, and strategies<br>\u2022 Community events and discussions<br>\u2022 Feedback &amp; bug report channels<br>\u2022 And plenty of chicken-fueled mayhem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Your voice matters.</strong><br>Whether you\u2019ve got suggestions, bug reports, or just want to share a funny in-game moment \u2014 we\u2019d love to hear from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you there!<br>\u2014 The ClusterCluck Team</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/4a2d285d848ed2fa859c376a2455fe75.avif?t=1752853368\" data-has-big width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ClusterCluck</strong> is a chaotic and fun-packed action game where crazy chickens battle each other in intense showdowns\u2014or sometimes team up to defend themselves against common enemies. With diverse game modes, dynamic encounters, and over-the-top chicken action, chaos is always guaranteed!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/0f18d89fae9528d03d05807702b2b9a5.poster.avif?t=1752853368\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/0f18d89fae9528d03d05807702b2b9a5.webm?t=1752853368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/0f18d89fae9528d03d05807702b2b9a5.mp4?t=1752853368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/4a2d285d848ed2fa859c376a2455fe75.avif?t=1752853368\" data-has-big width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ClusterCluck</strong> is a chaotic and fun-packed action game where crazy chickens battle each other in intense showdowns\u2014or sometimes team up to defend themselves against common enemies. With diverse game modes, dynamic encounters, and over-the-top chicken action, chaos is always guaranteed!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/0f18d89fae9528d03d05807702b2b9a5.poster.avif?t=1752853368\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/0f18d89fae9528d03d05807702b2b9a5.webm?t=1752853368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/0f18d89fae9528d03d05807702b2b9a5.mp4?t=1752853368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
